        "promise": "Collect a small set of public GPU prices and compare them with published specifications.",
        "whatItIs": "Flopper is a GPU hardware explorer. Its maker says it combines GPU specifications, workload estimates, and prices from dozens of providers. The maker also notes that reliable quotes for some large systems are difficult to obtain, so listings are not complete procurement quotes. A student version could track a few consumer GPUs and public provider pages, showing dated prices beside basic specifications. Small AI teams or hardware shoppers might pay for such a comparison, but this customer and willingness to pay are hypotheses. The automated part is checking selected pages and recording changes. A person should confirm the exact model, configuration, availability, and final price before relyin",
